Mean regret per operator over 332 cells per log; 80 SMs; lower is better.
Regret is a plan's time over the best plan's time in the same cell, minus 1.
Each fit tries 576 threshold combinations on one log and scores the winner
on the other log. 'gain' is the current rule's regret minus the fitted rule's, in
percentage points, on the log the fit did not see.

